id: zooming-third-eye
name: Zooming Third Eye
talentCategory: racial
race: earthling
prerequisites: Earthling, Triclops Factor
description: >
  Thanks to the uncanny vision granted by your third eye, none can escape your sight.
text: >
  Zooming Third Eye: Thanks to the uncanny vision granted by your third eye, none can escape your sight.
  –Prerequisites: Earthling, Triclops Factor
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Perception Skill Bonus by 2.
  (2)-[Passive]: You cannot suffer from the Long Range Penalty.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase the Strike Rolls of your Signature Techniques by 1(T).

---

[passive]
# (1)
skill.perception += 2;
# (2) (maneuvers.mjs longRangePenalty).
allow longRange.ignore;
# (3) (technique-attack.mjs techniqueStrikeParts).
strike.signature += 1(T);
